```

### 8.2 Additional Functions Required
- `extractResourceHours()`: Parse resource hours from table
- `calculateWorkingWeeks()`: Perform working weeks calculation  
- `updateWorkingWeeksDisplay()`: Update banner display
- `generateExplanationTooltip()`: Create calculation breakdown

### 8.3 Enhanced Error Handling
- Extend existing error handling to cover resource hours extraction
- Maintain graceful degradation - show existing features even if working weeks fails
- Log specific errors for debugging

## 9. Updated Testing Scenarios

### 9.1 New Functional Tests
- [ ] Working weeks calculation accuracy for various hour values
- [ ] Highest hours selection from multiple resources
- [ ] Explanation popup display and content accuracy
- [ ] Error handling for missing Team Members table
- [ ] Update synchronization with existing cost calculations
- [ ] Tooltip/popup accessibility and keyboard navigation

### 9.2 Integration Tests
- [ ] All existing Fixed Fee Plugin functionality remains unchanged
- [ ] Banner layout accommodates new component without breaking
- [ ] Performance impact assessment with additional DOM monitoring
- [ ] Multi-currency support compatibility with new feature

### 9.3 Edge Cases
- [ ] Table with all zero hour resources
- [ ] Resources with same highest hours (duplicate values)
- [ ] Time formats with minutes ("312h58" vs "312h")
- [ ] Very large hour values (1000h+)
- [ ] Rapid table content changes

## 10. Backward Compatibility
- **Existing Users**: No impact on current plugin functionality
- **Graceful Degradation**: Working weeks feature fails silently if table unavailable
- **Settings Preservation**: Existing percentage settings and cost calculations unaffected
- **Performance**: Minimal additional overhead using existing DOM monitoring

